{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016_02_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:de35133b50209a66dc6035784ad18121b4d70e120ebc21881c2849e4e1cf958b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21c731b1af5bfa66255300ef06841bf0f839dbbe0146db6c9f5400f8069d1f72",
      "text": "来，百百人！\n你从以前开始就很喜欢这个吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41a4e0eca36bce6cc83ae059dac4db84a37445abfca166fb505c119aa4d0ad3",
      "text": "哦，今天早上全是百百人爱吃的大餐啊。\n怎么样，百百人。好吃吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:545c21a23be4f8f16a0dc418ce8fc046a08c27f3131a1ffe2212d0f39d3c728a",
      "text": "哇……真的耶。\n谢谢妈妈。我开动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8f2838218d20a82853686a34ae9c8cccc72f4af4465a796de16823ce5715a65",
      "text": "……嗯，好好吃！\n妈妈做饭真厉害呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d14242859be4ac147aca6d3328c790c67adfd98e4a608c6d18936bd3705f328",
      "text": "我昨天特意为了百百人练习过了呢。\n做了好多，要多吃点哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd4e23cffb2f3fd5bfc3e4118b6f0352587978a2922c094e895acf8e25215d23",
      "text": "两个人一边这么说着，一边把我不喜欢吃的东西摆上桌，\n笑得十分开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61278ad504b4e54f8f7d9566b7e05a1c400e40f3bb259bfaf55556a76a7a16bd",
      "text": "我虽然不知道有什么好笑的，\n但也一直在笑着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f4c5ba46d946fe16191ad32670137c70fa557ad322d982bb766aa38d1a33b0b",
      "text": "我直到最后，都没能成为这个家的一员。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef659d539e663b960a6ba86dcd343befa3213be38cfcea17a069c36200a691c6",
      "text": "……那天，等我放学回到家，\n妈妈已经离开了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1065158460543dc36477bb42ea76122726d327eaa56b4b171cb397f4d19ef0af",
      "text": "变得冷清的家里，\n只有爸爸偶尔会回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_02_1_1_016_02:1_1_016_02_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4390ec63ce6b0480c5dff1c48b07ca85491a6bf7871849df375ef1676ca5a745",
      "text": "自从那一天的早饭之后，\n我们之间就再也没有过像样的对话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
